:"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:83a74cf4765f807511d5b9857c695043e7b2656361db084a9a45f089389e7e7e","file":"preprints/A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":39,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"680e2111892bdb66a20171b0cfa48e7b604b54a837f796855da84665068910f4","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:83a74cf4765f807511d5b9857c695043e7b2656361db084a9a45f089389e7e7e","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L39"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{main:theorem}\nThere exist a contractible domain $M\\subset\\C^3$, a smooth complete\nK\\\"ahler metric $g$ on $M$, and finite constants $0<A\\le B$ such that\n\\[\n -B\\le K_g(\\sigma)\\le -A<0\n\\]\nfor every real two-plane $\\sigma\\subset T_pM$ and every $p\\in M$.\nNo bounded holomorphic map $F:M\\to\\C^3$ has a nowhere-vanishing Jacobian\ndeterminant. In particular, $M$ is not biholomorphic to a bounded domain\nin $\\C^3$."}
